{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1773233050035,"sessionID":"ses_32312ffbdffekKZRMBm56hbQiX","part":{"id":"prt_cdced114c001JFy9JljL4xBeM2","sessionID":"ses_32312ffbdffekKZRMBm56hbQiX","messageID":"msg_cdced016e001CJ84YPEl1UAiZ0","type":"tool","callID":"call_function_yxay0hxxz9fg_1","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/h-mab/learn/localforge/.chief/prds/refactor-native-menu/progress.md"},"output":"<path>/home/h-mab/learn/localforge/.chief/prds/refactor-native-menu/progress.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>1: ## [2026-03-11 16:30] - US-001\n2: \n3: - What was implemented\n4:   - Restructured File menu with submenus (Projects, Virtual Hosts, Services)\n5:   - Added Preferences menu item that opens Settings view\n6:   - Added Window menu with About option\n7:   - Added Help menu with Restart App and Check for Updates\n8:   - Removed Edit, Navigation, View menus\n9:   - Implemented menu label localization (Khmer/English) that updates when language changes\n10:   - Created useMenuNavigation composable to handle menu-driven navigation with sub-views\n11: - Files changed\n12:   - src/main/menu.js - Complete restructure with translations\n13:   - src/main/main.js - Removed dark-mode-changed listener\n14:   - src/renderer/src/App.vue - Updated to handle new navigation events with sub-view parameters\n15:   - src/renderer/src/views/ManageProjectView.vue - Added menu navigation support\n16:   - src/renderer/src/views/ManageVirtualHostView.vue - Added menu navigation support\n17:   - src/renderer/src/views/ManageServicesView.vue - Added menu navigation support\n18:   - src/renderer/src/composables/useMenuNavigation.js - New composable for menu-driven navigation\n19: \n20: - **Learnings for future iterations:**\n21:   - Electron menus don't have direct access to Vue i18n - translations must be defined in the main process\n22:   - Use IPC to communicate between main process and renderer for menu actions\n23:   - Views with internal state (like activeView) need a shared composable to respond to menu navigation\n24:   - The menu labels are updated by rebuilding the entire menu when language changes\n25:   - Sub-menu item labels should match the internal state values used by view components for easy mapping\n26: \n27: ---\n28: \n29: ## [2026-03-11 16:45] - US-002\n30: \n31: - What was implemented\n32:   - Verified Edit, Navigation, View menus are removed (already done in US-001)\n33:   - Verified Dark Mode toggle is available in Settings/Preferences\n34:   - Verified Language selector is available in Settings/Preferences\n35: \n36: - Files changed\n37:   - No new files needed - functionality already exists in PreferenceSettings.vue\n38: \n39: - **Learnings for future iterations:**\n40:   - US-002 acceptance criteria were already satisfied during US-001 implementation\n41:   - PreferenceSettings.vue already contains Dark Mode toggle and Language selector\n42:   - Menu bar only contains File, Window, and Help menus\n43: \n44: ---\n45: \n46: ## [2026-03-11 17:00] - US-003\n47: \n48: - What was implemented\n49:   - Window menu already had Minimize and About items (added in US-001)\n50:   - Created AboutModal component to display app info when About is clicked\n51:   - Added IPC listener for 'show-about' event in App.vue\n52:   - Added translation keys for \"about.version\" in both Khmer and English\n53: \n54: - Files changed\n55:   - src/renderer/src/components/common/AboutModal.vue - New modal component\n56:   - src/renderer/src/App.vue - Added AboutModal and IPC listener\n57:   - src/renderer/src/i18n/locales/en.js - Added translation key\n58:   - src/renderer/src/i18n/locales/km.js - Added translation key\n59: \n60: - **Learnings for future iterations:**\n61:   - The Window menu already had About menu item sending 'show-about' IPC event\n62:   - The renderer needs to listen for IPC events from main process\n63:   - Modal components follow the same pattern as SuccessModal using Dialog and DialogContent from shadcn/ui\n\n(End of file - total 63 lines)\n</content>","title":".chief/prds/refactor-native-menu/progress.md","metadata":{"preview":"## [2026-03-11 16:30] - US-001\n\n- What was implemented\n  - Restructured File menu with submenus (Projects, Virtual Hosts, Services)\n  - Added Preferences menu item that opens Settings view\n  - Added Window menu with About option\n  - Added Help menu with Restart App and Check for Updates\n  - Removed Edit, Navigation, View menus\n  - Implemented menu label localization (Khmer/English) that updates when language changes\n  - Created useMenuNavigation composable to handle menu-driven navigation with sub-views\n- Files changed\n  - src/main/menu.js - Complete restructure with translations\n  - src/main/main.js - Removed dark-mode-changed listener\n  - src/renderer/src/App.vue - Updated to handle new navigation events with sub-view parameters\n  - src/renderer/src/views/ManageProjectView.vue - Added menu navigation support\n  - src/renderer/src/views/ManageVirtualHostView.vue - Added menu navigation support\n  - src/renderer/src/views/ManageServicesView.vue - Added menu navigation support\n  - src/renderer/src/composables/useMenuNavigation.js - New composable for menu-driven navigation\n\n- **Learnings for future iterations:**","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"time":{"start":1773233049961,"end":1773233050029}}}}
