e-400 hover:underline\"\n547:                             >\n548:                               <Link class=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n549:                               http://{{ config.name }}\n550:                             </a>\n551:                           </div>\n552:                         </div>\n553: \n554:                         <!-- Configuration Info -->\n555:                         <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs\">\n556:                           <div class=\"bg-white/50 dark:bg-gray-800/50 p-2 rounded\">\n557:                             <span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\"\n558:                               >{{ locale === 'km' ? 'ឈ្មោះដែន' : 'Domain' }}:</span\n559:                             >\n560:                             <p class=\"font-mono font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">\n561:                               {{ config.name }}\n562:                             </p>\n563:                           </div>\n564:                           <div class=\"bg-white/50 dark:bg-gray-800/50 p-2 rounded\">\n565:                             <span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\"\n566:                               >{{ locale === 'km' ? 'ស្ថានភាព' : 'Status' }}:</span\n567:                             >\n568:                             <p class=\"font-semibold text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">\n569:                               {{ config.enabled ? t('active') : t('inactive') }}\n570:                             </p>\n571:                           </div>\n572:                         </div>\n573:                         <div class=\"bg-white/50 dark:bg-gray-800/50 p-2 rounded text-xs\">\n574:                           <span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\"\n575:                             >{{ locale === 'km' ? 'ផ្លូវគម្រោង' : 'Path' }}:</span\n576:                           >\n577:                           <p class=\"font-mono text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 break-all\">\n578:                             {{ config.path }}\n579:                           </p>\n580:                         </div>\n581:                       </div>\n582:                     </div>\n583:                   </Transition>\n584:                 </div>\n585:               </div>\n586:             </div>\n587: \n588:             <!-- Active Sites without HTTPS -->\n589:             <div\n590:               v-if=\"activeSitesWithoutSSL.length > 0\"\n591:               class=\"bg-yellow-50 dark:bg-yellow-900/20 border border-yellow-200 dark:border-yellow-700 rounded-lg p-4\"\n592:             >\n593:               <h4\n594:                 class=\"font-semibold text-yellow-800 dark:text-yellow-300 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\"\n595:               >\n596:                 <CheckCircle2 class=\"h-5 w-5\" />\n597:                 {{ locale === 'km' ? 'គេហទំព័រសកម្ម (គ្មាន HTTPS)' : 'Active Sites (No HTTPS)' }}\n598:                 <span\n599:                   class=\"ml-auto px-2 py-0.5 text-xs bg-yellow-100 dark:bg-yellow-900 text-yellow-700 dark:text-yellow-300 rounded-full\"\n600:                 >\n601:                   {{ activeSitesWithoutSSL.length }}\n602:                 </span>\n603:               </h4>\n604:               <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n605:                 <div\n606:                   v-for=\"config in activeSitesWithoutSSL\"\n607:                   :key=\"config.name\"\n608:                   class=\"flex items-center justify-between bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-4 rounded-lg border border-yellow-300 dark:border-yellow-700\"\n609:                 >\n610:                   <div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\">\n611:                     <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1\">\n612:                       <Code2 class=\"h-5 w-5 text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 flex-shrink-0\" />\n613:                       <span class=\"font-semibold text-yellow-700 dark:text-yellow-400 truncate\">{{\n614:                         config.name\n615:                       }}</span>\n616:                       <span\n617:                         class=\"px-2 py-0.5 text-xs bg-yellow-100 dark:bg-yellow-900 text-yellow-700 dark:text-yellow-300 rounded flex-shrink-0\"\n618:                       >\n619:                         {{ t('active') }}\n620:                       </span>\n621:                     </div>\n622:                     <div\n623:                       class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 ml-7\"\n624:                     >\n625:                       <Folder class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0\" />\n626:                       <span class=\"truncate\">{{ config.path }}</span>\n627:                     </div>\n628:                   </div>\n629:                   <div\n630:                     :ref=\"(el) => setDropdownRef(el, config.name)\"\n631:                     class=\"ml-4 relative flex-shrink-0\"\n632:                   >\n633:                     <button\n634:                       class=\"px-3 py-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg transition-colors\"\n635:                       :title=\"locale === 'km' ? 'សកម្មភាព' : 'Actions'\"\n636:                       @click=\"toggleDropdown(config.name)\"\n637:                     >\n638:                       <MoreVertical class=\"h-5 w-5\" />\n639:                     </button>\n640:                     <div\n641:                       v-if=\"openDropdown === config.name\"\n642:                       :class=\"getDropdownClasses(config.name)\"\n643:                       class=\"absolute right-0 w-48 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 py-1 z-10\"\n644:                     >\n645:                       <button\n646:                         class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 text-left text-sm text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 flex items-center gap-2\"\n647:                         @click=\"loadConfigForEdit(config.name)\"\n648:                       >\n649:                         <Pencil class=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n650:                         {{ locale === 'km' ? 'កែសម្រួល' : 'Edit' }}\n651:                       </button>\n652:                       <div class=\"border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 my-1\" />\n653:                       <button\n654:                         class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 text-left text-sm text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 flex items-center gap-2\"\n655:                         @click=\"handleAddSsl(config.name)\"\n656:                       >\n657:                         <Lock class=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n658:                         {{ locale === 'km' ? 'បន្ថែម HTTPS' : 'Add HTTPS' }}\n659:                       </button>\n660:                       <button\n661:                         class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 text-left text-sm text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 flex items-center gap-2\"\n662:                         @click=\"handleDisableConfig(config.name)\"\n663:                       >\n664:                         <Ban class=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n665:                         {{ locale === 'km' ? 'បិទដំណើរការ' : 'Disable' }}\n666:                       </button>\n667:                       <div class=\"border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 my-1\" />\n668:                       <button\n669:                         class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 text-left text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-red-50 dark:hover:bg-red-900/20 flex items-center gap-2\"\n670:                         @click=\"handleDeleteConfig(config.name)\"\n671:                       >\n672:                         <Trash2 class=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n673:                         {{ t('delete') }}\n674:                       </button>\n675:                     </div>\n676:                   </div>\n677:                 </div>\n678:               </div>\n679:             </div>\n680: \n681:             <!-- Inactive/Disabled Sites -->\n682:             <div\n683:               v-if=\"inactiveSites.length > 0\"\n684:               class=\"bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900/50 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-lg p-4\"\n685:             >\n686:               <h4\n687:                 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\"\n688:               >\n689:                 <CircleX class=\"h-5 w-5\" />\n690:                 {{ t('nginxInactiveSites') }}\n691:                 <span\n692:                   class=\"ml-auto px-2 py-0.5 text-xs bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-full\"\n693:                 >\n694:                   {{ inactiveSites.length }}\n695:                 </span>\n696:               </h4>\n697:               <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n698:                 <div\n699:                   v-for=\"config in inactiveSites\"\n700:                   :key=\"config.name\"\n701:                   class=\"flex items-center justify-between bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600\"\n702:                 >\n703:                   <div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\">\n704:                     <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1\">\n705:                       <Code2 class=\"h-5 w-5 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0\" />\n706:                       <span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 truncate\">{{\n707:                         config.name\n708:                       }}</span>\n709:                       <span\n710:                         class=\"px-2 py-0.5 text-xs bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 rounded flex-shrink-0\"\n711:                       >\n712:                         {{ t('inactive') }}\n713:                       </span>\n714:                       <span\n715:                         v-if=\"config.hasSSL\"\n716:                         class=\"px-2 py-0.5 text-xs bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 rounded flex items-center gap-1 flex-shrink-0\"\n717:                         :title=\"locale === 'km' ? 'មាន SSL/HTTPS' : 'SSL/HTTPS Enabled'\"\n718:                       >\n719:                         <Lock class=\"h-3 w-3\" />\n720:                         HTTPS\n721:                       </span>\n722:                     </div>\n723:                     <div\n724:                       class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 ml-7\"\n725:                     >\n726:                       <Folder class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0\" />\n727:                       <span class=\"truncate\">{{ config.path }}</span>\n728:                     </div>\n729:                   </div>\n730:                   <div\n731:                     :ref=\"(el) => setDropdownRef(el, config.name)\"\n732:                     class=\"ml-4 relative flex-shrink-0\"\n733:                   >\n734:                     <button\n735:                       class=\"px-3 py-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg transition-colors\"\n736:                       :title=\"locale === 'km' ? 'សកម្មភាព' : 'Actions'\"\n737:                       @click=\"toggleDropdown(config.name)\"\n738:                     >\n739:                       <MoreVertical class=\"h-5 w-5\" />\n740:                     </button>\n741:                     <div\n742:                       v-if=\"openDropdown === config.name\"\n743:                       :class=\"getDropdownClasses(config.name)\"\n744:                       class=\"absolute right-0 w-48 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 py-1 z-10\"\n745:                     >\n746:                       <button\n747:                         class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 text-left text-sm text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 flex items-center gap-2\"\n748:                         @click=\"loadConfigForEdit(config.name)\"\n749:                       >\n750:                         <Pencil class=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n751:                         {{ locale === 'km' ? 'កែសម្រួល' : 'Edit' }}\n752:                       </button>\n753:                       <div class=\"border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 my-1\" />\n754:                       <button\n755:                         class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 text-left text-sm text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 flex items-center gap-2\"\n756:                         @click=\"handleEnableConfig(config.name)\"\n757:                       >\n758:                         <CheckCircle2 class=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n759:                         {{ locale === 'km' ? 'បើកដំណើរការ' : 'Enable' }}\n760:                       </button>\n761:                       <button\n762:                         v-if=\"!config.hasSSL\"\n763:                         class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 text-left text-sm text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 flex items-center gap-2\"\n764:                         @click=\"handleAddSsl(config.name)\"\n765:                       >\n766:                         <Lock class=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n767:                         {{ locale === 'km' ? 'បន្ថែម HTTPS' : 'Add HTTPS' }}\n768:                       </button>\n769:                       <button\n770:                         v-if=\"config.hasSSL\"\n771:                         class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 text-left text-sm text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 flex items-center gap-2\"\n772:                         @click=\"handleRemoveSsl(config.name)\"\n773:                       >\n774:                         <LockOpen class=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n775:                         {{ locale === 'km' ? 'ដក HTTPS' : 'Remove HTTPS' }}\n776:                       </button>\n777:                       <div class=\"border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 my-1\" />\n778:                       <button\n779:                         class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 text-left text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-red-50 dark:hover:bg-red-900/20 flex items-center gap-2\"\n780:                         @click=\"handleDeleteConfig(config.name)\"\n781:                       >\n782:                         <Trash2 class=\"h-4 w-4\" />\n783:                         {{ t('delete') }}\n784:                       </button>\n785:                     </div>\n786:                   </div>\n787:                 </div>\n788:               </div>\n789:             </div>\n790:           </div>\n791:         </div>\n792:       </div>\n793:     </div>\n794:   </div>\n795: </template>\n796: \n797: <script setup>\n798: import { ref, computed, onMounted, onBeforeUnmount, inject, nextTick, watch } from 'vue'\n799: import { useI18n } from 'vue-i18n'\n800: import {\n801:   AlertCircle,\n802:   Ban,\n803:   CheckCircle2,\n804:   ChevronRight,\n805:   CircleX,\n806:   Code2,\n807:   FileText,\n808:   Folder,\n809:   Link,\n810:   Lock,\n811:   LockOpen,\n812:   MoreVertical,\n813:   Pencil,\n814:   RefreshCw,\n815:   Search,\n816:   SearchX,\n817:   Star,\n818:   Trash2,\n819: } from 'lucide-vue-next'\n820: import { useNginx } from '../composables/useNginx'\n821: import { useStatus } from '../composables/useStatus'\n822: import { useTools } from '../composables/useTools'\n823: import { useFavorites } from '../composables/useFavorites'\n824: import { useMenuNavigation } from '../composables/useMenuNavigation'\n825: import { domainSchema, pathSchema, validateField } from '../utils/validation'\n826: import DirectorySelector from '../components/common/DirectorySelector.vue'\n827: import AlertNotification from '../components/common/AlertNotification.vue'\n828: import CustomSelect from '../components/common/CustomSelect.vue'\n829: import VirtualHostSidebar from '../components/virtual-host/VirtualHostSidebar.vue'\n830: import phpIcon from '@/assets/svg/php.svg'\n831: import laravelIcon from '@/assets/svg/laravel.svg'\n832: import wordpressIcon from '@/assets/svg/wordpress.svg'\n833: import vueIcon from '@/assets/svg/vuejs.svg'\n834: import nuxtIcon from '@/assets/svg/nuxtjs.svg'\n835: import reactIcon from '@/assets/svg/react.svg'\n836: import htmlIcon from '@/assets/svg/html5.svg'\n837: \n838: const { t, locale } = useI18n()\n839: const {\n840:   configureNginx,\n841:   isConfiguring,\n842:   listNginxConfigs,\n843:   deleteNginxConfig,\n844:   enableNginxConfig,\n845:   disableNginxConfig,\n846:   addSslToConfig,\n847:   removeSslFromConfig,\n848:   getNginxConfigDetails,\n849:   isLoading,\n850: } = useNginx()\n851: const status = useStatus()\n852: const { installedTools, checkInstalledTools } = useTools()\n853: const { toggleFavorite, isFavorite } = useFavorites()\n854: const errorModal = inject('errorModal', null)\n855: \n856: const projectType = ref('php')\n857: const domain = ref('')\n858: const nginxProjectPath = ref('')\n859: const phpVersion = ref('')\n860: const port = ref(80)\n861: const enableSSL = ref(false)\n862: const configs = ref([])\n863: const activeMenu = ref('sites')\n864: const { menuActiveView, clearMenuActiveView } = useMenuNavigation()\n865: \n866: watch(menuActiveView, (newView) => {\n867:   if (newView === 'new') {\n868:     activeMenu.value = 'new-site'\n869:     clearMenuActiveView()\n870:   } else if (newView === 'manage') {\n871:     activeMenu.value = 'sites'\n872:     clearMenuActiveView()\n873:   }\n874: })\n875: \n876: onMounted(() => {\n877:   if (menuActiveView.value === 'new') {\n878:     activeMenu.value = 'new-site'\n879:     clearMenuActiveView()\n880:   } else if (menuActiveView.value === 'manage') {\n881:     activeMenu.value = 'sites'\n882:     clearMenuActiveView()\n883:   }\n884: })\n885: \n886: const openDropdown = ref(null)\n887: const dropdownRefs = ref({})\n888: const dropdownPositions = ref({})\n889: const validationErrors = ref({})\n890: const expandedSite = ref(null)\n891: const searchQuery = ref('')\n892: const statusFilter = ref('all')\n893: const sslFilter = ref('all')\n894: const editMode = ref(false)\n895: const editingConfigName = ref(null)\n896: \n897: // Optimized: single-pass filtering for better performance\n898: const filteredConfigs = computed(() => {\n899:   const query = searchQuery.value?.toLowerCase()\n900: \n901:   return configs.value.filter((config) => {\n902:     // Search filter\n903:     if (\n904:       query &&\n905:       !config.name.toLowerCase().includes(query) &&\n906:       !config.path.toLowerCase().includes(query)\n907:     ) {\n908:       return false\n909:     }\n910: \n911:     // Status filter\n912:     if (statusFilter.value === 'active' && !config.enabled) return false\n913:     if (statusFilter.value === 'inactive' && config.enabled) return false\n914: \n915:     // SSL filter\n916:     if (sslFilter.value === 'https' && !config.hasSSL) return false\n917:     if (sslFilter.value === 'no-https' && config.hasSSL) return false\n918: \n919:     return true\n920:   })\n921: })\n922: \n923: // Computed properties to separate sites by status and SSL (using filtered configs)\n924: const activeSitesWithSSL = computed(() =>\n925:   filteredConfigs.value.filter((config) => config.enabled && config.hasSSL)\n926: )\n927: const activeSitesWithoutSSL = computed(() =>\n928:   filteredConfigs.value.filter((config) => config.enabled && !config.hasSSL)\n929: )\n930: const inactiveSites = computed(() => filteredConfigs.value.filter((config) => !config.enabled))\n931: \n932: onMounted(async () => {\n933:   await checkInstalledTools()\n934:   loadCachedConfigs()\n935:   await loadConfigs()\n936:   document.addEventListener('click', handleClickOutside)\n937: })\n938: \n939: onBeforeUnmount(() => {\n940:   document.removeEventListener('click', handleClickOutside)\n941: })\n942: \n943: function loadCachedConfigs() {\n944:   try {\n945:     const cached = localStorage.getItem('nginxConfigs')\n946:     if (cached) {\n947:       configs.value = JSON.parse(cached)\n948:     }\n949:   } catch (error) {\n950:     // eslint-disable-next-line no-console\n951:     console.error('Failed to load cached configs:', error)\n952:   }\n953: }\n954: \n955: function saveCachedConfigs() {\n956:   try {\n957:     localStorage.setItem('nginxConfigs', JSON.stringify(configs.value))\n958:     localStorage.setItem('nginxConfigsTimestamp', Date.now().toString())\n959:   } catch (error) {\n960:     // eslint-disable-next-line no-console\n961:     console.error('Failed to save cached configs:', error)\n962:   }\n963: }\n964: \n965: async function loadConfigs() {\n966:   try {\n967:     configs.value = await listNginxConfigs()\n968:     saveCachedConfigs()\n969:   } catch (error) {\n970:     // eslint-disable-next-line no-console\n971:     console.error('Failed to load configs:', error)\n972:   }\n973: }\n974: \n975: async function loadConfigForEdit(configName) {\n976:   closeDropdown()\n977:   try {\n978:     const details = await getNginxConfigDetails(configName)\n979: \n980:     // Populate form with existing values\n981:     domain.value = details.domain || ''\n982:     nginxProjectPath.value = details.projectPath || ''\n983:     projectType.value = details.projectType || 'php'\n984:     port.value = details.port || 80\n985:     phpVersion.value = details.phpVersion || ''\n986:     enableSSL.value = details.hasSSL || false\n987: \n988:     // Set edit mode\n989:     editMode.value = true\n990:     editingConfigName.value = configName\n991: \n992:     // Switch to new-site menu\n993:     activeMenu.value = 'new-site'\n994:   } catch (error) {\n995:     status.showStatus(\n996:       locale.value === 'km'\n997:         ? `កំហុសក្នុងការផ្ទុកការកំណត់: ${error.message}`\n998:         : `Error loading config: ${error.message}`,\n999:       'error'\n1000:     )\n1001:   }\n1002: }\n1003: \n1004: function cancelEdit() {\n1005:   // Reset form\n1006:   domain.value = ''\n1007:   nginxProjectPath.value = ''\n1008:   projectType.value = 'php'\n1009:   port.value = 80\n1010:   phpVersion.value = ''\n1011:   enableSSL.value = false\n1012:   validationErrors.value = {}\n1013: \n1014:   // Exit edit mode\n1015:   editMode.value = false\n1016:   editingConfigName.value = null\n1017: }\n1018: \n1019: async function toggleDropdown(configName) {\n1020:   if (openDropdown.value === configName) {\n1021:     openDropdown.value = null\n1022:   } else {\n1023:     openDropdown.value = configName\n1024:     await nextTick()\n1025:     checkDropdownPosition(configName)\n1026:   }\n1027: }\n1028: \n1029: function closeDropdown() {\n1030:   openDropdown.value = null\n1031: }\n1032: \n1033: function checkDropdownPosition(configName) {\n1034:   const dropdownElement = dropdownRefs.value[configName]\n1035:   if (!dropdownElement) return\n1036: \n1037:   const rect = dropdownElement.getBoundingClientRect()\n1038:   const dropdownHeight = 250\n1039:   const spaceBelow = window.innerHeight - rect.bottom\n1040:   const spaceAbove = rect.top\n1041: \n1042:   dropdownPositions.value[configName] =\n1043:     spaceBelow < dropdownHeight && spaceAbove > spaceBelow ? 'up' : 'down'\n1044: }\n1045: \n1046: function handleClickOutside(event) {\n1047:   if (openDropdown.value) {\n1048:     const dropdownElement = dropdownRefs.value[openDropdown.value]\n1049:     if (dropdownElement && !dropdownElement.contains(event.target)) {\n1050:       closeDropdown()\n1051:     }\n1052:   }\n1053: }\n1054: \n1055: function getDropdownClasses(configName) {\n1056:   const position = dropdownPositions.value[configName]\n1057:   return position === 'up' ? 'bottom-full mb-2' : 'mt-2'\n1058: }\n1059: \n1060: function setDropdownRef(el, configName) {\n1061:   if (el) {\n1062:     dropdownRefs.value[configName] = el\n1063:   }\n1064: }\n1065: \n1066: function toggleSiteDetails(configName) {\n1067:   if (expandedSite.value === configName) {\n1068:     expandedSite.value = null\n1069:   } else {\n1070:     expandedSite.value = configName\n1071:   }\n1072: }\n1073: \n1074: function validateDomain() {\n1075:   const result = validateField(domainSchema, 'domain', domain.value)\n1076:   if (!result.valid) {\n1077:     validationErrors.value.domain = result.error\n1078:   } else {\n1079:     delete validationErrors.value.domain\n1080:   }\n1081: }\n1082: \n1083: function validatePath() {\n1084:   const result = validateField(pathSchema, 'path', nginxProjectPath.value)\n1085:   if (!result.valid) {\n1086:     validationErrors.value.path = result.error\n1087:   } else {\n1088:     delete validationErrors.value.path\n1089:   }\n1090: }\n1091: \n1092: async function handleDeleteConfig(configName) {\n1093:   closeDropdown()\n1094:   const confirmMessage =\n1095:     locale.value === 'km'\n1096:       ? `តើអ្នកប្រាកដថាចង់លុបការកំណត់រចនាសម្ព័ន្ធ \"${configName}\" មែនទេ? សកម្មភាពនេះមិនអាចត្រឡប់វិញបានទេ។`\n1097:       : `Are you sure you want to delete the configuration \"${configName}\"? This action cannot be undone.`\n1098: \n1099:   if (!confirm(confirmMessage)) {\n1100:     return\n1101:   }\n1102: \n1103:   try {\n1104:     await deleteNginxConfig(configName)\n1105:     status.showStatus(\n1106:       locale.value === 'km' ? `បានលុប ${configName} ជោគជ័យ` : `Successfully deleted ${configName}`,\n1107:       'success'\n1108:     )\n1109:     await loadConfigs()\n1110:   } catch (error) {\n1111:     status.showStatus(\n1112:       locale.value === 'km'\n1113:         ? `កំហុសក្នុងការលុប: ${error.message}`\n1114:         : `Error deleting: ${error.message}`,\n1115:       'error'\n1116:     )\n1117:   }\n1118: }\n1119: \n1120: async function handleEnableConfig(configName) {\n1121:   closeDropdown()\n1122:   try {\n1123:     await enableNginxConfig(configName)\n1124:     status.showStatus(\n1125:       locale.value === 'km'\n1126:         ? `បានបើកដំណើរការ ${configName} ជោគជ័យ`\n1127:         : `Successfully enabled ${configName}`,\n1128:   